window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-4dc36da9f78a68da"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"measure-business-impact\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">撰写业务影响评估</h1> <p>将实验或上线结果转化为扩大、调整或停止的建议。</p> <p>向 ChatGPT 提供实验或上线计划、成功指标、分组数据、仪表板导出、客户反馈和上线说明，请它量化提升幅度、检查护栏指标、解释不同细分群组的差异，并起草有来源依据的影响评估。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>需要明确建议扩大、调整还是停止的实验、上线或计划。</li> <li>需要比较不同群组或细分人群的提升幅度，同时检查护栏指标的团队。</li> <li>需要将方法、注意事项、已确认结果与解释分开呈现的评估报告。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>计算提升幅度、护栏指标和细分群组差异，并整理支持性表格或图表。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive（需联网）</a></td> <td>阅读实验计划、仪表板导出文件、群组数据表和上线说明。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>创建适合利益相关者阅读的影响评估，并说明方法和限制。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>撰写业务影响评估</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>high</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">衡量 [initiative, experiment, or launch] 是否改善了 [target outcome]。\n\n使用我提供的实验或上线计划、成功指标、相关仪表板、群组或分配数据、客户反馈和上线说明。量化提升幅度或指标变化，检查护栏指标，分析不同细分群组的差异，并解释团队应扩大、调整还是停止这项工作。\n\n请返回一份业务影响评估，包含图表、方法说明、注意事项、来源链接和明确建议。将已确认结果与解释分开，并标出缺失的输入。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/codex-for-work/how-data-science-teams-use-codex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy：数据科学团队（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/datasets-and-reports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">分析数据集并交付报告（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>如需完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"start-with-the-decision-the-readout-must-support\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">先明确评估报告要支持什么决策</h2> <p>影响评估应把结果与某项决策联系起来，例如扩大、调整或停止。提供实验或上线计划、成功指标、群组、护栏指标和客户背景，让 ChatGPT 说明数据能够支持什么结论。</p> <ol> <li>说明计划或项目、目标结果、评估时间段和决策负责人。</li> <li>附上计划、指标定义、分配或群组数据、仪表板和上线说明。</li> <li>要求 ChatGPT 在撰写建议前先验证输入，并解释分析方法。</li> <li>使用起始提示词，检查提升幅度、护栏指标和细分群组差异。</li> <li>与分析人员或实验负责人一起审核方法、注意事项和缺失数据。</li> </ol> <p>将测量结果与解释分开。如果实验设计或数据不足以支持因果结论，请让 ChatGPT 收窄表述，而不是填补证据缺口。</p> <p><a id=\"audit-the-recommendation\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">审核建议</h2> <p>分享评估报告之前，请让 ChatGPT 对建议及其中最重要的数字进行简明的证据核查。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Audit the business impact readout.\n\nCheck:\n\n- every material number against its source\n- the lift calculation and comparison group\n- guardrail metrics\n- segment differences and sample gaps\n- methodology limitations\n- claims that go beyond the data\n- whether scale, change, or stop is actually supported\n\nReturn corrections and open questions without changing the source data.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">请审查业务影响分析报告。\n\n检查：\n\n- 每个重要数字是否与来源一致\n- 提升幅度的计算方式和对照组\n- 护栏指标\n- 不同细分群体之间的差异和样本缺口\n- 方法的局限性\n- 超出数据支持范围的主张\n- 现有证据是否确实支持扩大规模、调整或停止\n\n返回修正内容和待解答的问题，不要更改来源数据。</div></div>","en":"<h1 id=\"measure-business-impact\">Measure business impact</h1> <p>Turn experiment or launch results into a scale, change, or stop recommendation.</p> <p>Give ChatGPT an experiment or launch plan, success metrics, cohort data, dashboard exports, customer signals, and launch notes, then ask it to quantify lift, check guardrails, explain segments, and draft a sourced impact readout.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Experiments, launches, or initiatives that need a clear scale, adjust, or stop recommendation.</li> <li>Teams comparing lift across cohorts or segments while checking guardrail metrics.</li> <li>Readouts that need methodology, caveats, and confirmed results separated from interpretation.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>Calculate lift, guardrails, segment differences, and supporting tables or charts.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive (online)</a></td> <td>Read experiment plans, dashboard exports, cohort tables, and launch notes.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>Create a stakeholder-ready impact readout with methodology notes and caveats.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Write a business impact readout</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>high</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Measure whether [initiative, experiment, or launch] improved [target outcome].\n\nUse the experiment or launch plan, success metrics, relevant dashboards, cohort or assignment data, customer signals, and launch notes I provide. Quantify lift or movement, check guardrail metrics, inspect segment differences, and explain whether the team should scale, change, or stop the initiative.\n\nReturn a business impact readout with charts, methodology notes, caveats, source links, and a clear recommendation. Separate confirmed results from interpretation and flag any missing inputs.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/codex-for-work/how-data-science-teams-use-codex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy: Data science teams (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/datasets-and-reports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Analyze datasets and ship reports (online)</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"start-with-the-decision-the-readout-must-support\">Start with the decision the readout must support</h2> <p>An impact readout should connect the result to a decision, such as scale, adjust, or stop. Provide the experiment or launch plan, success metrics, cohorts, guardrails, and customer context so ChatGPT can show what the data supports.</p> <ol> <li>Name the initiative, target outcome, evaluation window, and decision owner.</li> <li>Attach the plan, metric definitions, assignment or cohort data, dashboards, and launch notes.</li> <li>Ask ChatGPT to validate inputs and explain the analysis method before writing the recommendation.</li> <li>Run the starter prompt and check lift, guardrails, and segment differences.</li> <li>Review methodology, caveats, and missing data with the analyst or experiment owner.</li> </ol> <p>Keep measured results separate from interpretation. If the design or data cannot support a causal claim, ask ChatGPT to narrow the language rather than fill the gap.</p> <h2 id=\"audit-the-recommendation\">Audit the recommendation</h2> <p>Before sharing the readout, ask for a compact evidence audit focused on the recommendation and its most important numbers.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Audit the business impact readout.\n\nCheck:\n\n- every material number against its source\n- the lift calculation and comparison group\n- guardrail metrics\n- segment differences and sample gaps\n- methodology limitations\n- claims that go beyond the data\n- whether scale, change, or stop is actually supported\n\nReturn corrections and open questions without changing the source data.\n</code></pre>"};
